  "prefLabel": "Puc 402.19 Telecommunications relay service (TRS)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 402.19 \"Telecommunications relay service (TRS)\" means a service that enables telephone communication between hearing people and people who are deaf, hard of hearing or speech impaired.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Puc 400) #14029, eff 7-25-24",
